---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { dots } from '../lib/patterns.js';
const ask = `mailto:${site.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Software for my business')}`;
const bodyBg = dots();
---
<Base title="Software solutions for any business" description="Software and phone apps built around how your business already works: one login for your staff and customers, your records in a place you own, and the tools you already use connected.">
  <Hero variant="graph" seed={23} tall mapLabel="My portfolio" mapTo="/products" eyebrow="Software solutions · Any business" title="Stop bending your business to fit someone else's software.">
    <p class="lede">Off-the-shelf software makes you work its way. I learn how your business runs and build around it, with your leaders' input at every step: the customer portal, the scheduling, the billing, and the reports, behind one login. You own the code and the data.</p>
    <a slot="actions" class="btn btn-secondary " href={ask}>Ask about your software</a>
  </Hero>

  <section class="section band-parallax">
    <div class="band-bg" set:html={bodyBg} aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="prototyping">Your vision, working in days</h2>
      <p>The beauty of a small studio is speed. We prototype fast, and we build from <em>your</em> vision, not a template. You describe the tool you wish you had; within days you are clicking through a working version of it. Then we change it together until it fits, and only then build it out.</p>
      <h2>What you get</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Software built around how you work, with logins for your staff and, if you want, your customers.</li>
        <li>Your records kept in a place you own, backed up, and easy to take with you.</li>
        <li>Connections to the tools you keep: payments, email, calendars, and accounting.</li>
        <li>A phone app for your staff or customers, when the work happens away from a desk.</li>
        <li>Working software every week, a written guide at the end, and optional monthly care.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Good fit if</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You run the business on spreadsheets, email, and subscriptions that do not talk to each other.</li>
        <li>You pay per seat for features you never use and still lack the one you need.</li>
        <li>You have outgrown the off-the-shelf tool you started with.</li>
        <li>Your people work in the field and need the system on their phones.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="phone-apps">iOS &amp; Android</h2>
      <p>I build phone apps that connect to the rest of your system, so your crew can check a job, approve a request, or send a photo without a laptop.</p>
      <p><span class="tag">Fixed scope</span> <span class="tag">You own the code</span> <span class="tag">Optional monthly care</span> <span class="tag">Quote on scope</span></p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={ask}>Ask about your software</a> <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/products">See our products</a></p>
      <p class="muted">Need only a website? I build those too. <a href="https://flourishfinancialgroup.org">Flourish Financial Group</a> went live a month after the first conversation and costs $0 a month to host.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
